而獨厚遇灌將軍。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m011-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"l26_mjw_rwe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m011-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"灌將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m011-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m011-0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"灌將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-107","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p013","text":"潁陰侯言之上，上以夫為中郎將。數月，坐法去。後家居長安，長安中諸公莫弗稱之。孝景時，至代相。孝景崩，今上初即位，以為淮陽天下交，勁兵處，故徙夫為淮陽太守。建元元年，入為太仆。二年，夫與長樂衛尉竇甫飲，輕重不得，夫醉，搏甫。甫，竇太后昆弟也。上恐太后誅夫，徙為燕相。數歲，坐法去官，家居長安。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"潁陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"d4q_icw_co6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"夫","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_44g_vef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"4gj_xfa_r7s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"今上","kind":"person","person_id":"gni_rru_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m013-0070","start":70,"end